# UI system: drafting sheet

`docs/ui/` is the source of truth. This rule summarises it; when they disagree, `docs/ui/` wins.

The whole site is a drafting sheet: near-black ink on off-white paper, IBM Plex, radius 0, hairline rules, and one orange mark colour used only on marks. Dark mode is the same sheet reversed. Hierarchy comes from size, weight and rules.

The earlier Lautan Pasir system (cobalt ink on cream paper, Literata italic, riso grain, an engraving band, the caldera logo) and the older monochrome / grayscale language, Instrument Serif, Bricolage Grotesque, Inter, JetBrains Mono, `MacWindow` panels and glass surfaces are retired. Never reintroduce them.

## Tokens

Defined in `src/app/globals.css` (HSL triples, `:root` and `.dark`) and exposed in `tailwind.config.ts`.

| Class | Light | Dark | Role |
|---|---|---|---|
| `paper` | #F7F7F5 | #141414 | Page, card, text on solid ink |
| `ink` | #141414 | #F2F2EE | Text, icons, strong rules, solid button, charts |
| `ink-soft` | #5C5C57 | #A3A39C | Secondary text (paper or tint only) |
| `rule` | #DCDCD7 | #33332F | Decorative hairlines |
| `rule-strong` | #8A8A84 | #75756F | Control boundaries |
| `tint` | #EDEDE9 | #1F1F1D | Hover row, code ground, inset |
| `mark` | #FF4F00 | #FF6326 | Marks only (see Orange) |
| `mark-text` | #C03A00 | #FF7A45 | Orange text, where unavoidable |
| `on-mark` | #141414 | #141414 | Text on a `mark` fill, in both themes |

- shadcn names map onto these (`background`/`card`/`popover` = paper, `foreground`/`primary`/`destructive` = ink, `ring` = mark, `muted`/`secondary`/`accent` = tint, `muted-foreground` = ink-soft, `border` = rule, `input` = rule-strong). `src/__tests__/unit/lib/contrast.test.ts` guards the contrast floors.
- **Never**: palette colours (`blue-500`, `neutral-*`, `zinc-*`, ...), hex in class names, `white` / `black`, opacity on text (`text-foreground/70`), `dark:` variants. Tokens flip on `<html class="dark">`.
- Status, errors and destructive actions are shape plus word (8px square filled / outline / dashed, SVG cross, explicit verb). No red, green or amber.

## Orange

`mark` appears only on: the focus ring (`--ring`), the active nav underline (`aria-[current=page]:decoration-mark`), the article reading hairline, the crop marks on plates and the logo `mark` variant, the last point of a chart line, and text selection (`mark` fill, `on-mark` text). Primary buttons and links stay ink. If orange must carry text, use `mark-text`. Raw `orange-*` classes stay banned.

## Type

- IBM Plex via `next/font/google`. Plex Sans (variable, normal style) is the whole voice: `font-sans` is `--font-sans`, `font-display` is only an alias. Plex Mono (400/500, `--font-mono`) is `font-mono`. `font-synthesis: none`.
- Headings carry weight 600 on the `text-h1` to `text-h4` and `text-display` size tokens; `display` and `h1` set letter-spacing -0.02em. Body and captions are 400.
- No italic anywhere. `<em>`, `<i>` and `<cite>` render upright at weight 500, `<strong>` at 600. The TipTap italic mark stays so authored content keeps its meaning.
- Plex Mono only for code, kbd, slugs, keys, raw JSON and title-block values; never for small decorative labels. Figures stay in Plex Sans with `tabular-nums`.
- Sentence case. No `uppercase`, no `tracking-[...]`, no all-caps eyebrows, no middle-dot meta strings, no mono small labels, no "→" on links, numbered markers only for real sequences. Links underline 1px, 2px on hover. `tabular-nums` in ledgers, tables, figures.

## Three surfaces only

| Surface | Code | Use for |
|---|---|---|
| **Frame** | `Card`, `Surface variant="solid"` (`rounded-none border border-border bg-transparent`) | Content boxes, form slips, profile card |
| **Inset** | `Surface variant="inset"` (`bg-muted`) | Nested rows, code specimens, hover rows |
| **Lift** | `bg-paper border border-ink shadow-[3px_3px_0_hsl(var(--ink))]` | Floating layers only: Dialog, AlertDialog, Sheet, Popover, DropdownMenu, Tooltip, Select, Command, toasts, tracker drag |

- `glass` / `glass-static` are retired aliases of frame. Do not use them.
- Radius 0 everywhere; the radio dot is the only circle.
- No gradients, glass, `backdrop-blur`, glows, `shadow-sm`..`shadow-2xl`, hover lifts. Hover = rule turns ink or row takes `bg-tint`.
- Lines: hairline 1px rule; strong 1px ink; active 2px ink underline; double rule only on page heads and above the colophon; dotted leaders; dashed = draft or archived.

## Shell and page patterns

`BaseLayout` (`bleed?`, `footer?: 'full' | 'compact' | 'none'`) renders the sticky running head, the menu sheet, `main#main` and the colophon (`TitleBlock`). No sidebars, no navbar, no scroll-to-top. Do not add horizontal padding inside it. Nav comes only from `src/commons/constants/navigation-menu.ts`.

| Pattern | Component | Routes |
|---|---|---|
| Ledger | `ui/ledger.tsx` | `/blog`, `/certificates`, `/changelog`, `/project` index, home Career and Credentials, admin lists |
| Article | `ui/article-shell.tsx` | `/blog/[slug]`, `/blog/onsite/[slug]`, `/project/[id]`, `/roadmap/[slug]`, `/legal/*` |
| Plates | `ui/plate-figure.tsx` | Covers, project shots, portrait, OCR specimen |
| Cabinet | `tools/_components/tool-shell.tsx` + `ui/pager.tsx` | `/tools`, `/ai` |
| Correspondence | Letters column, replies behind a left rule | `/chat`, `/ai` chat, home Contact, admin Feedback |
| Board | Ruled columns of index cards | `/tracker` |
| Figures | `StatStrip`, `ui/ink-chart.tsx`, `ui/ink-heatmap.tsx`, `HatchBar` | `/stats`, home Readers, admin dashboard and analytics |
| Admin | Ruled spine, `--admin-rail` | `/admin/dashboard/*` |
| Auth | `layout/auth-shell.tsx` | `/auth/*`, `/admin/auth/login` |
| Profile card | Double-rule sheet, definition list | `/profile`, `/profile/edit`, admin settings |
| Not found | `ui/not-found-view.tsx` | 404s, `error.tsx`, empty states |

- Widths via the `PAGE_WIDTH` presets in `src/lib/design-system.ts` (`default`, `prose`, `article`, `wide`, `ledger`). Section rhythm via `PageSection` (`mt-16 sm:mt-24`). Titles via `SectionHeading` (no `marker`).
- Charts are server SVG (`InkChart`, `InkHeatmap`, `HatchBar`). Never add recharts.
- Photos use `PlateFigure`: 1px ink frame, four orange crop marks, grayscale (`tone="color"` for site OG covers, the OCR upload and sprites). Avatars use `.plate` with no marks. Logo only through `<Logo variant="mini" | "mark" | "tile">`.
- Ornaments are plain 1px rules (`hr`, `.tail-piece`). No fleuron, grain, speckle, engraving or duotone.
- Home hero: the portrait (`HeroPortrait`) is in the masthead stage, the right column from 1024px and directly after the lead line below it. About is one text column.
- Fields are baseline only (`border-0 border-b border-input`). Buttons: `bg-ink text-paper`, never a `Button` inside a `Link` (use `asChild`).

## Motion

- Tier 0 (no JS): native scroll, sticky layouts, `[id] { scroll-margin-top: calc(var(--head-h) + 1rem) }` (never `scroll-padding-top` on `html`: it scrolls the page whenever focus lands in the sticky head). `overflow-x: clip` on `html` and `main` only; never on `body`; never `overflow: hidden` / `auto` or `content-visibility` on a sticky ancestor.
- Tier 1 (CSS, `@supports (animation-timeline: view())` + no-preference): home wordscroll and article reading hairline. Nothing else is scroll-linked.
- Response motion only: underline, `active:translate-y-px`, tab underline, accordion, dialog and sheet fade + 4px, toasts, tracker drag.
- **Banned:** parallax, marquees, typing effects, smooth cursor, page transitions, pulsing dots, pulse skeletons, fade-up / reveal on sections, `BlurFade`, Lenis, GSAP, `motion` / framer-motion. Nothing autoplays.
- Reduced motion: durations .01ms, wordscroll fully inked, sticky stays.

## Umami events

- `data-umami-event` only on `<button>` and external `target="_blank"` links. On an internal `<a>` the tracker calls `preventDefault` and reloads the page.
- Internal links: `data-track="nav-click" data-track-item="blog"`; the delegated listener in `deferred-client-utilities.tsx` forwards them. In code use `track()` from `src/lib/analytics.ts`.
- Kebab-case, 50 characters or fewer, enum values only, one event per element, never PII. Event table in `docs/ui/components.md`.

## Grep gates

All three must print nothing: gate 1 bans classes, gate 2 bans literals, gate 3 keeps the retired Lautan Pasir system out. Gates 1 and 2 take `$PHASE_PATHS` (the files you touched, or `src` for a full run); gate 3 runs over `src content`. Hex copies of the tokens live only in `src/lib/print-hex.ts` and the generated `src/app/icon.svg`. Never add a new hit; make touched files pass.

```bash
grep -rnIE "uppercase|tracking-[[]|(text|bg|border|from|to|via|ring|fill|stroke|divide|outline)-(green|red|yellow|orange|emerald|teal|violet|purple|blue|sky|indigo|amber|pink|rose|lime|cyan|neutral|zinc|slate|gray)-[0-9]{2,3}|shadow-(sm|md|lg|xl|2xl)|backdrop-blur|rounded-(sm|md|lg|xl|2xl|3xl|full)|dark:|BlurFade|from .motion|recharts" $PHASE_PATHS | grep -v "radio-group.tsx"
grep -rnIE "bg-gradient|gradient-to|(text|bg|border|fill|stroke|ring|from|to|via)-(white|black)\b|[\"' ]rounded[\"' ]|rounded-\[|rounded-(t|b|l|r|tl|tr|bl|br)-|#[0-9a-fA-F]{6}\b|text-(foreground|primary|muted-foreground)/[0-9]" $PHASE_PATHS content | grep -vE "code-block|kbd|api/(og|certificate)|lib/print-hex|app/icon\.svg"
grep -rnIE "\bitalic\b|font-style: ?italic|engrav|grain|speckle|Literata|plate-filters|logo-mask|#1E3C9E|#F3ECDC|#0D1433|#EFE6D2|Hollar|Tengger|caldera" src content \
  | grep -vE "content/changelog/(2025-|2026-0|2026-10-19)|rich-text-editor.tsx"
```

## Checklist before shipping UI

- [ ] Route uses one page pattern
- [ ] Ink / paper tokens only; orange only where the Orange list allows; no hex, palette colours, `white` / `black`, `dark:`
- [ ] Only frame, inset or lift
- [ ] Plex Sans for text, Plex Mono only for machine text; no italic
- [ ] No banned motion; reduced motion works
- [ ] Umami attributes follow the button / external-link rule
- [ ] Accessible: `aria-current`, 44px targets under 768px, chart text alternatives, no horizontal scroll at 375px
- [ ] All three grep gates print nothing
